          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "exposedToUI": true,
  "usageDescription": "This action is triggered by:\n\n- **Opening the home screen**: The \"היום\" screen of the collections workspace runs it once as soon as it opens (the last result for the same view shows instantly while the fresh one loads), again when the user switches the top-bar filter between \"שלי\" and \"של כולם\", and when the user clicks \"רענון\" at the top of the screen\n  Fills the whole screen: on the right the week at a glance (\"השבוע במבט אחד\") for this calendar week from the aging report (the headline, the short list of conclusions, the four totals, the week board by day with every invoice due, promise, claimed payment and query, and the customers overdue with no note), and on the left Nina's short summary of today's bank transfers (how many were pulled, how many are already matched and how many are left to match)."
}